# CloudFormation templates.
#
# Prettier's YAML formatter collapses folded block scalars (`Description: >`)
# and silently drops content from them - it removed ~47 lines of the explanatory
# header from readonly-role.yaml. CloudFormation also uses short-form
# intrinsics (!Ref, !Sub, !GetAtt) that are not portable YAML tags. Neither is
# worth reformatting; both are worth not corrupting.
infra/*.yaml

# Drizzle's generated migration metadata.
#
# `drizzle-kit generate` rewrites these on every run, so formatting them means
# every schema change arrives with an unrelated reformat in the diff. The
# migration SQL beside them is reviewed; this is the tool's bookkeeping.
apps/api/drizzle/meta
